    "body": "Quick pass (author side, not a review): merges cleanly; built with zola 0.23.6 (the version release.yml pins) at the Pages base URL; `search_index.en.js` is generated, and test queries return hits. **Maintainer decision needed:** this vendors a third-party JS file, `site/static/vendor/elasticlunr.min.js` (0.9.5, MIT, unmodified, with its licence file), so the search works with no outside service. That's a new dependency for the site, so please confirm. No `.github` change. Ready for NeoTech's review. (M5)",
